ext("C031", " Report 64 (Critique AI): the one repeated defect is a freeze during AI plan generation (May 2025 and Apr 2026, independently), then on every launch for one reviewer; crashes on every AI review and on the coach tab 'after the update' ('I expect better from an app which costs like 30 dollars').")
ext("C141", " Report 64 (Critique AI): the app 'refuses to work on iPad' for a payer who also could not log in on a second device.")
